[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0468","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0468.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0589","title":"Flowerfire Sawmill 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"Flowerfire Sawmill 5.0.21 使用弱加密算法存储用户密码，攻击者可通过获取密码存储文件后利用加密算法的弱点直接解密出明文密码，进而登录管理后台修改 SawMill 配置，获取系统控制权。该漏洞源于程序对密码仅进行了简单的可逆编码处理而非安全的哈希加盐存储，攻击难度较低，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0589"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sawmill 至 5.0.21 以上版本（厂商在 2000 年 7 月已发布修复版本），新版本改用强加密算法存储密码。如无法升级，手动加密配置文件中的密码字段，并将配置文件的文件权限设为仅管理员可读（chmod 600），同时限制对 Sawmill Web 管理界面的网络访问范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0271.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0080.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1403","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20042","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0589.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0589","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0589.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0589.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6r6c-fvxf-rg87/GHSA-6r6c-fvxf-rg87.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0589.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1403/info.html","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/sawmill_password.nasl","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0468.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0468.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0467","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0467.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0588","title":"Flowerfire Sawmill 5.0.21 CGI 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"SawMill 5.0.21 CGI 程序存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 rfcf 参数传递目标文件路径，使 SawMill 尝试将该文件内容解析为配置命令，从而读取任意文件的第一行。该漏洞影响 Flowerfire Sawmill 5.0.21 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级中危，可能导致敏感信息泄露。目前官方已发布更新版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0588"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03Z","remediation":"升级 Sawmill 至 5.0.22 或更高版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache/Nginx）限制对 cgi-bin/sawmill.cgi 的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 访问，或移除该 CGI 脚本的 SUID 权限。同时检查并过滤 rfcf 参数输入，禁止包含路径遍历字符（如 ../）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0271.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0080.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1402","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20041","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0588.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0588","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0588.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0588.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/