/etc/rc.conf 中将 ifconfig 配置从 \"DHCP\" 改为静态 IP 地址，并停止 dhclient 进程以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0247.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0014.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000628","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_56.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1388","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4772","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0585.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0585","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0585/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0585.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0585.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-c3g3-gg38-8jjw/GHSA-c3g3-gg38-8jjw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0585.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20000628.data","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0585.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1300.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0735","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0735.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0611","title":"NetWin dMailWeb/cwMail POP服务器默认信任配置拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetWin DMailWeb 和 CWMail 2.6g 版本的 POP 服务器存在安全配置缺陷，默认配置下信任所有 POP 服务器，导致远程攻击者无需有效认证即可绕过身份验证机制，向目标服务器发送恶意构造的 POP 请求，从而触发拒绝服务状态。该漏洞影响 NetWin DMailWeb 及 CWMail 2.6g 版本，攻击者无需任何权限即可通过网络远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前厂商已发布相关修复建议，建议用户升级至最新版本或修改默认信任配置以降低风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0611"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即迁移至受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Dovecot 或 Microsoft Exchange），并停用 dMailWeb/cwMail 服务。若无法立即迁移，可在 dMailWeb/cwMail 配置文件中将 trusted_pop_servers 参数设为空列表，仅允许本地认证，同时在防火墙限制仅信任的 POP 服务器 IP 访问 110 端口，以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0243.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1391","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4771","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0611.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0611","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0611.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0611.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cf29-9472-gh5p/GHSA-cf29-9472-gh5p.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0611.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0611.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--eccdfd2b-d0b6-4fe0-a076-d077238e822c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0735.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0733","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0733.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0610","title":"NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 安全绕过漏洞","description":"NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 2.6g 及更早版本存在身份认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在用户名中插入回车符（carriage return）绕过认证机制，利用该服务器进行邮件中继（mail relay），发送垃圾邮件或恶意邮件。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响邮件服务器的正常使用和网络安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0610"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 NetWin dMailWeb/cwMail 2.6g 及更早版本，迁移至受支持的邮件服务器（如 Postfix、Exim）。若无法立即替换，应在防火墙层面限制对 SMTP 端口（25/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并禁用邮件中继功能。该软件已停止维护，无官方补丁可用，长期使用存在严重安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0243.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1390","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4770","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0610.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0610","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0610.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0610.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-68cc-r228-pw9r/GHSA-68cc-r228-pw9r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0610.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b5f85739-4032-4407-9706-b9fdd3ca07ac.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0733.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0744","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0744.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0618","title":"Red Hat Linux xconq/cconq 游戏程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 系统中的 xconq 和 cconq 游戏程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于程序在处理 DISPLAY 环境变量时未正确限制输入长度，本地攻击者可通过向该环境变量传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致程序执行异常。成功利用此漏洞的本地攻击者可获取额外的系统权限，实现权限提升，影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要本地访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0618"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 xconq/cconq 到已修复该缓冲区溢出漏洞的版本（如 xconq 7.2.1 及以上），或从 Red Hat 官方获取对应安全补丁。由于 Red Hat Linux 6.x/7.x 已停止维护，建议升级到受支持的现代 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 发行版。临时缓解措施：移除 xconq 和 cconq 二进制文件的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/xconq /usr/bin/cconq），并在启动脚本中对 DISPLAY 环境变量长度做限制校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0222.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0618.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0618","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0618.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0618.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x4xf-2prm-xx25/GHSA-x4xf-2prm-xx25.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0618.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/dc712452b4b330ce9a69a7312562b32027c700f5/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0744.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0654","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0654.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0562","title":"Internet Security Systems BlackICE 安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"BlackICE Defender 2.1及更早版本、BlackICE Pro 2.0.23及更早版本中存在安全策略绕过漏洞。当安全级别设置为 Nervous 或更低时，该入侵检测系统无法正确识别和拦截 Back Orifice（BO）远程管理木马的通信流量。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞绕过防火墙和入侵检测机制，通过 BO 木马对目标系统实施未授权远程控制，导致敏感信息泄露、数据篡改或服务中断。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0562"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00Z","remediation":"将 BlackICE Defender 升级至 2.1 以上版本，或将 BlackICE Pro 升级至 2.0.23 以上版本，并将安全级别设置为 Nervous 以上以确保正确拦截 Back Orifice 流量。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至现代主机入侵防御系统（如 Windows Defender Firewall + EDR 方案）以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0190.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0562.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0562","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0562.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0562.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v25j-6rjr-73r2/GHSA-v25j-6rjr-73r2.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/blackice_version_checker.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0562.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0562.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0654.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0619","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0619.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0540","title":"Allaire JRun 2.3.x JSP文件访问控制漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 2.3.x 的 JSP 示例文件存在访问控制缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过直接访问 viewsource.jsp 等示例页面，读取服务器上的任意文件内容或获取系统配置信息。该漏洞源于 JRun 默认安装时未对示例文件进行适当的权限限制，攻击者只需发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可利用，影响所有运行 Allaire JRun 2.3.x 版本的服务器，可能导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0540"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57Z","remediation":"立即删除 JRun 安装目录下的 `jsp/` 示例文件（特别是 `viewsource.jsp`），或通过 Web 服务器（如 IIS/Apache）的访问控制规则禁止外部访问 `/jsp/` 路径。升级到 Allaire JRun 3.0 及以上版本，该版本已移除存在漏洞的示例文件。如无法升级，在应用服务器前端部署反向代理并配置 URL 白名单，仅允许业务必需的 JSP 路径通过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=16290&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/2713","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1386","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0540","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f2806e104de98b7d2d4c0d641eaee278be53a2c8/2000/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4b74680d5a0e543abc5d2cd403e55944096555a8/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-05xx/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0540.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0540.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0619.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0619.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0619.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0617","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0617.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0539","title":"Allaire JRun Servlet 示例信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 2.3.x 中的 Servlet 示例组件存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过访问 SessionServlet 等示例 Servlet，获取 HttpSession ID 等敏感信息，进而可能利用获取的会话标识符劫持其他用户的会话。该漏洞影响 JRun 2.3.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。厂商已发布安全公告建议删除或限制对示例 Servlet 的访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0539"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57Z","remediation":"删除 JRun 安装目录下的 Servlet 示例文件（特别是 SessionServlet），或确保生产环境不部署示例应用。JRun 2.3.x 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Adobe ColdFusion 或其他受支持的 Java Web 服务器，并遵循最小化安装原则移除所有示例组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=16290&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/818","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1386","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0539.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0539","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0539.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0539.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wwgv-vf3h-hmgf/GHSA-wwgv-vf3h-hmgf.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0539.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0539.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/DDI_JRun_Sample_Files.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0617.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0617.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0478","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0478.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0617","title":"Red Hat Linux Xconq 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 系统中 Stanley T. Shebs Xconq 7.2.2 版本的 xconq 和 cconq 游戏程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 USER 环境变量传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取额外的系统权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 系统，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，利用方式简单，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0617"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 xconq 至 7.4.1 以上版本，或从 Red Hat 官方获取安全补丁。如无法升级，可执行 `chmod g-s /usr/bin/xconq /usr/bin/cconq` 移除 SGID games 权限位，或使用 `rpm -e xconq` 卸载该游戏程序以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0222.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20093","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0617.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0617","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0617.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0617.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7g5j-fq3f-v5q2/GHSA-7g5j-fq3f-v5q2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0617.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0478.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0730","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0730.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0609","title":"Netwin DMailWeb/CWMail 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 2.6g 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向用户名参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出或资源耗尽，导致邮件服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本的 NetWin 邮件服务器，攻击门槛低，无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），主要影响系统可用性。建议升级至 2.6g 之后的修复版本或应用厂商发布的补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0609"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06Z","remediation":"建议升级至 NetWin dMailWeb/cwMail 2.6g 之后的修复版本。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全更新的替代邮件服务软件。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层对 username 参数实施长度限制（如限制不超过 64 字符），并配置访问控制策略仅允许可信 IP 访问管理接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1376","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-06-15&msg=4.1.20000621113334.00996820%40qlink.queensu.ca","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0609.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0609","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0609.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0609.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-82f3-pqxp-8f9v/GHSA-82f3-pqxp-8f9v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0609.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0609.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1376/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--696f3f7c-d9e3-4858-96e3-63e1d01dac02.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0730.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0730.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0726","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0726.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0608","title":"NetWin DMailWeb/CWMail POP 参数远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 2.6i 及更早版本的 POP 服务中存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，只需向目标服务器的 POP 端口发送一个超长的 `pophost` 参数，即可导致服务进程崩溃或进入无响应状态，造成正常的邮件服务中断。该漏洞攻击门槛低，危害中等，CVSS 评分 5.0，影响 dMailWeb 和 cwMail 2.6i 及之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0608"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 NetWin 新版 WebMail 产品（https://netwinsite.com/webmail）。如无法立即迁移，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层限制 pophost 参数长度不超过 256 字符，并在防火墙中限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 dmailweb/cwmail 服务，以降低远程 DoS 攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1376","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-06-15&msg=4.1.20000621113334.00996820%40qlink.queensu.ca"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0726.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0726.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0726.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0723","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0723.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0606","title":"Mandrake Linux kon 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux Kanji on Console（KON）软件包中的 kon 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 kon 程序传递超长的 -StartupMessage 参数触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用此漏洞可获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响使用 KON 软件包的 Linux 发行版，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0606"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05Z","remediation":"立即卸载 KON (Kanji on Console) 软件包，该软件包已停止维护且不再被任何主流 Linux 发行版支持。如因特殊需求必须使用，请限制本地用户对 kon 程序的执行权限，通过 chmod 750 /usr/bin/kon 移除其他用户的执行权限，并确保非授权用户无法传递 -StartupMessage 参数。建议迁移至现代终端模拟器（如 GNOME Terminal、Konsole 或 xterm）替代 KON 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1371","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006192340340.19998-100000%40ferret.lmh.ox.ac.uk","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0606.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0606","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0606.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0606.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rxxv-f2jp-v9vp/GHSA-rxxv-f2jp-v9vp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0606.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a1067ac4-2003-47e8-bd54-a6107aab65d4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0606.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0723.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0719","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0719.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0604","title":"Red Hat Linux gkermit 文件修改漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 系统中 gkermit 文件传输工具被错误地设置了 setgid uucp 权限，导致普通用户在执行 gkermit 时继承 uucp 组的特权。本地攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用此配置缺陷，通过 gkermit 修改 uucp 用户组拥有的文件，进而可能提升权限或破坏系统文件完整性。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 发行版，攻击前提是拥有本地 shell 访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0604"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05Z","remediation":"立即移除 gkermit 二进制文件的 setgid 权限位：执行 `chmod g-s /usr/bin/gkermit` 取消 setgid uucp 设置，防止本地用户利用该权限修改 uucp 用户拥有的文件。如环境仍在使用 Red Hat Linux，建议升级到已修复此问题的更新版本或迁移至受支持的企业级 Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1383","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006211209500.22969-100000%40nimue.tpi.pl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0604.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0604","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0604.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0604.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h3fp-c6fr-mp9h/GHSA-h3fp-c6fr-mp9h.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0604.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/eaa97ba9c844b54a10a95d8ecd7a959309defaf3/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0719.toml"}]